\frac{{y}_{\\text{min}}+{y}_{\\text{max}}}{2} & =\\frac{-7+3}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{-4}{2} \\\\  & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the midline is $y=-2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-236893/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "933b20c7-323f-5443-9cf4-97e87fa2c6fc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-236893"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-236899/selection/dfa879c5187361c521910305b1d33c758fc2fbdab2d984242b7e043b37074919" :answer/id #uuid "655cf1f8-cb4b-594a-b3ac-e97915212d55" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-236899/selection/1a618d000210c17b3718f6e886c0c2f878226da4c6b1f8f0b9a530761419003f" :answer/id #uuid "acbfb4a9-33f4-55c6-9083-31bab49c5833" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-236899/selection/ab35b5d31934a29f264b13e06671189d17ea95205c6933037fe20d8b552aa57e" :answer/id #uuid "e6bfa076-d19f-5128-bf4b-ad2e7b7b2c0e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-236899/selection/356ee3c2b52002c7e96541f36ece87e0db15b24bea96cb27964c7d42b3b148f4" :answer/id #uuid "65ae3a00-eaff-518f-aa6a-069a60c20c6b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-236899/selection/6423513e171b5afa79ca48e931898185940a85ebaaf6dadd11a6f2d566c91a49" :answer/id #uuid "16a8fdc1-bce7-5a63-950a-a9c72ac5be44" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-236899/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "605da068-1e77-5423-8f48-953021d9373f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-236899/selection/ab35b5d31934a29f264b13e06671189d17ea95205c6933037fe20d8b552aa57e" :answer-field/choices ["q-236899/selection/dfa879c5187361c521910305b1d33c758fc2fbdab2d984242b7e043b37074919" "q-236899/selectio